Spark : open source technology, in memory processing, faster executions ,structured,semi, un structured ,4 languages
RDD :   RDD stands for resilient distributed datasets it is an fundamental Data structure
        of an apache spark.
        They are fault tolerant, means they can recover from node failure

narrow transformations :data stays in the same partition and faster no i/o 
        filter, where , select , union , withcolumn , drop 
 
wide transformations : requires data shuffling acrosss partiotions and slower due to high i/o 
        groupbuy , orderby ,distinct , joins , repartitioning

lazy evaluation : spark wont execute transformations instantly , it prepares logical execution plan (DAG)  that plans the sequence of actions to be done

PAIR RDD : key value pair 